<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Confirmation de Réservation - Maternia</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif; background: #f8f4f7; color: #333; }
        .wrapper { max-width: 620px; margin: 0 auto; background: #ffffff; border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(255, 92, 141, 0.12); }

        /* Header */
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF8AAB 0%, #d63384 50%, #E1BEE7 100%);
            padding: 40px 40px 30px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
        }
        .header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -1px; left: 0; right: 0;
            height: 30px;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 50% 50% 0 0;
        }
        .logo {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .logo-mark {
            width: 52px; height: 52px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
            border-radius: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 26px;
        }
        .logo-text { color: white; font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
        .header-title { color: white; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .header-subtitle { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size: 14px; }

        /* Status badge */
        .status-area { text-align: center; padding: 30px 40px 20px; }
        .status-icon {
            width: 80px; height: 80px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e8fdf0, #d4f1e0);
            border-radius: 50%; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-size: 38px; margin-bottom: 16px; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(40, 167, 69, 0.18);
        }
        .status-text { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #1a1a2e; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .status-sub { font-size: 14px; color: #888; }

        /* Reference badge */
        .ref-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff0f5, #fce4ec);
            border: 2px solid #fbcfe8;
            border-radius: 50px;
            padding: 10px 28px;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #d63384;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin: 10px 0 0;
        }

        /* Info card */
        .section { padding: 0 40px 30px; }
        .section-title {
            font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: #d63384;
            text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
        }
        .section-title::after { content: ''; flex: 1; height: 1px; background: #fce4ec; }
        .info-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 12px; }
        .info-item {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fdf8fc, #fff0f5);
            border: 1px solid #fce4ec;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 14px 16px;
        }
        .info-item.full { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
        .info-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #a0aec0; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.8px; margin-bottom: 4px; }
        .info-value { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #2d3748; }
        .info-value.highlight { color: #d63384; }

        /* Google Meet CTA */
        .meet-section {
            margin: 0 40px 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4285f4 0%, #34a853 50%, #673ab7 100%);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 28px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .meet-section::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute; inset: 0;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
        }
        .meet-section > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
        .meet-logo { font-size: 36px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
        .meet-title { color: white; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 6px; }
        .meet-subtitle { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .meet-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            background: white;
            color: #4285f4;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 16px;
            padding: 14px 36px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .meet-url {
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
            font-size: 11px;
            margin-top: 12px;
            word-break: break-all;
        }

        /* Instructions */
        .steps-section { padding: 0 40px 30px; }
        .step {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 14px;
            padding: 12px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #fce4ec;
        }
        .step:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .step-num {
            width: 32px; height: 32px; min-width: 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF8AAB, #d63384);
            color: white; border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
            font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px;
        }
        .step-text { font-size: 14px; color: #555; line-height: 1.5; padding-top: 5px; }
        .step-text strong { color: #333; }

        /* Alert box */
        .alert-box {
            margin: 0 40px 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fffbeb, #fef3c7);
            border: 1px solid #fde68a;
            border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #78350f;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .alert-box strong { color: #92400e; }

        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1a2e 0%, #16213e 100%);
            padding: 30px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .footer-logo { color: #FF8AAB; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px; }
        .footer-tagline { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .footer-links { margin-bottom: 16px; }
        .footer-link { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4); font-size: 11px; text-decoration: none; margin: 0 8px; }
        .footer-copy { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25); font-size: 11px; }
        .divider { height: 1px; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,138,171,0.3), transparent); margin: 20px 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div style="padding: 20px 0; background: #f8f4f7;">
    <div class="wrapper">

        <!-- HEADER -->
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo">
                <div class="logo-mark">🌸</div>
                <div class="logo-text">Maternia</div>
            </div>
            <div class="header-title">Confirmation de Réservation</div>
            <div class="header-subtitle">Clinique maternelle & pédiatrique de référence</div>
        </div>

        <!-- STATUS -->
        <div class="status-area">
            <div class="status-icon">✅</div>
            <div class="status-text">Votre rendez-vous est confirmé !</div>
            <div class="status-sub">Bonjour <strong>{{ reservation.prenomClient }} {{ reservation.nomClient }}</strong>, nous avons bien enregistré votre réservation.</div>
            <div class="ref-badge">Réf : #{{ reservation.reference }}</div>
        </div>

        <!-- INFOS PATIENT -->
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">👤 Informations Patient</div>
            <div class="info-grid">
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Nom complet</div>
                    <div class="info-value">{{ reservation.prenomClient }} {{ reservation.nomClient }}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Type de patient</div>
                    <div class="info-value">
                        {% if reservation.typePatient == 'BEBE' %}
                            👶 Bébé
                        {% else %}
                            🤰 Maman
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Email</div>
                    <div class="info-value highlight">{{ reservation.emailClient }}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Téléphone</div>
                    <div class="info-value">{{ reservation.telephoneClient }}</div>
                </div>
                {% if reservation.typePatient == 'MAMAN' and reservation.moisGrossesse %}
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Mois de grossesse</div>
                    <div class="info-value highlight">{{ reservation.moisGrossesse }} mois</div>
                </div>
                {% endif %}
                {% if reservation.typePatient == 'BEBE' and reservation.dateNaissanceBebe %}
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Date de naissance</div>
                    <div class="info-value">{{ reservation.dateNaissanceBebe|date('d/m/Y') }}</div>
                </div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- INFOS RDV -->
        {% if reservation.consultationCreneau %}
        <div class="section">
            <div class="section-title">📅 Détails du Rendez-vous</div>
            <div class="info-grid">
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Médecin</div>
                    <div class="info-value">Dr. {{ reservation.consultationCreneau.nomMedecin }}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Spécialité</div>
                    <div class="info-value">{{ reservation.consultationCreneau.consultation.categorie }}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Date</div>
                    <div class="info-value highlight">
                        {% if reservation.consultationCreneau.jour %}
                            {{ reservation.consultationCreneau.jour|date('d/m/Y') }}
                        {% else %}
                            {{ reservation.dateReservation|date('d/m/Y') }}
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Horaire</div>
                    <div class="info-value highlight">
                        {% if reservation.consultationCreneau.heureDebut and reservation.consultationCreneau.heureFin %}
                            {{ reservation.consultationCreneau.heureDebut|date('H:i') }} - {{ reservation.consultationCreneau.heureFin|date('H:i') }}
                        {% else %}
                            À confirmer
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Statut</div>
                    <div class="info-value highlight">{{ reservation.statutReservation }}</div>
                </div>
                <div class="info-item">
                    <div class="info-label">Durée estimée</div>
                    <div class="info-value">
                        {% if reservation.consultationCreneau.dureeMinutes %}
                            {{ reservation.consultationCreneau.dureeMinutes }} min
                        {% else %}
                            30 min
                        {% endif %}
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        {% endif %}

        <!-- GOOGLE MEET -->
        {% if meetLink %}
        <div class="meet-section">
            <div class="meet-logo">📹</div>
            <div class="meet-title">Rejoignez votre consultation en ligne</div>
            <div class="meet-subtitle">Votre rendez-vous se déroulera en visioconférence via Google Meet</div>
            <a href="{{ meetLink }}" class="meet-btn">📹 Rejoindre Google Meet</a>
            <div class="meet-url">{{ meetLink }}</div>
        </div>
        {% endif %}

        <!-- INSTRUCTIONS -->
        <div class="steps-section">
            <div class="section-title" style="padding: 0 0 0 0;">📋 À faire avant votre consultation</div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">1</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Préparez vos documents :</strong> Carnet de santé, ordonnances récentes, résultats d'analyses.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">2</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Arrivez à l'heure :</strong> Présentez-vous 10 minutes avant l'heure de votre rendez-vous.</div>
            </div>
            {% if meetLink %}
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">3</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Testez votre connexion :</strong> Assurez-vous que votre caméra et microphone fonctionnent avant la consultation.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">4</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>Rejoignez le Meet :</strong> Cliquez sur le lien Google Meet ci-dessus 5 minutes avant le début.</div>
            </div>
            {% endif %}
            <div class="step">
                <div class="step-num">{% if meetLink %}5{% else %}3{% endif %}</div>
                <div class="step-text"><strong>En cas d'empêchement :</strong> Annulez au moins 24h à l'avance au <strong>+216 XX XXX XXX</strong>.</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ALERT -->
        <div class="alert-box">
            ⚠️ <strong>Important :</strong> Conservez votre numéro de référence <strong>#{{ reservation.reference }}</strong> — vous en aurez besoin pour modifier ou annuler votre rendez-vous. Cet email est votre preuve de réservation officielle.
        </div>

        <!-- FOOTER -->
        <div class="footer">
            <div class="footer-logo">🌸 Maternia</div>
            <div class="footer-tagline">Votre santé maternelle & pédiatrique, notre priorité</div>
            <div class="divider"></div>
            <div class="footer-links">
                <a href="#" class="footer-link">Centre d'aide</a>
                <a href="#" class="footer-link">Conditions</a>
                <a href="#" class="footer-link">Confidentialité</a>
            </div>
            <div class="footer-copy">© {{ "now"|date("Y") }} Maternia. Tous droits réservés. Cet email a été envoyé à {{ reservation.emailClient }}</div>
        </div>

    </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
